  "question": {
    "text": "In the real number system, the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> has"
