  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>|</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>|</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that,&nbsp;</p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Equation has&nbsp;infinite many solutions.</p>"
